{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us on Discord! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm + Rich Story &amp; Characters.</strong> You play as a new student in Concordia Academy of Music, facing a crisis on your first day joining the Cajon Club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here you can play all kinds of music: Jazz, Rock, EDM, Classic, Country, Flamenco - Name your genres!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/a07f3775fec067cb2ae7d27262d8d1b2.poster.avif?t=1774232494\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/a07f3775fec067cb2ae7d27262d8d1b2.webm?t=1774232494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/a07f3775fec067cb2ae7d27262d8d1b2.mp4?t=1774232494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the story mode and free play mode, players can also engage in personal one-on-one conversations with their partners, deepening their bond while learning about music. They may visit the academy\u2019s arcade to play mini-games, redeem gifts for their partners at the store, or enjoy quiet reading in the library with short articles about music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/a9cfdb50eba05fb3e091be0853fffa8d.poster.avif?t=1774232494\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/a9cfdb50eba05fb3e091be0853fffa8d.webm?t=1774232494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/a9cfdb50eba05fb3e091be0853fffa8d.mp4?t=1774232494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Three Unique Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Fight: Music Duel</strong> <br>Boss fights are reimagined as live music showdowns. Use your ears to dissect the opponent's patterns, then replicate and dominate the groove. (Music school veterans will recognize this twist on audition-style rhythm dictation!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/a0c2dd6b04b1145f1c6cd5c45cad8aa6.poster.avif?t=1774232494\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/a0c2dd6b04b1145f1c6cd5c45cad8aa6.webm?t=1774232494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/a0c2dd6b04b1145f1c6cd5c45cad8aa6.mp4?t=1774232494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Jamming</strong><br>Up to 4 players can jam together locally. Not mirrored charts, but\u00a0a true ensemble with separate instrumental parts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/7af35b846df404ec171990b88368a0bf.poster.avif?t=1774232494\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/7af35b846df404ec171990b88368a0bf.webm?t=1774232494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/7af35b846df404ec171990b88368a0bf.mp4?t=1774232494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with a Real Cajon</strong> <br>Crush beats using actual acoustic cajons. Works with most standard cajons right out of the box.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/271b9367d7606fff8dbfd1c178be104d.poster.avif?t=1774232494\" width=856 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/271b9367d7606fff8dbfd1c178be104d.webm?t=1774232494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693720/extras/271b9367d7606fff8dbfd1c178be104d.mp4?t=1774232494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Unbreakable Machine-Gear...?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3693720/b9d97cce239734dad224ad4da24840beeed8a222.jpg"},{"name":"To save Cajon Club, I'll become cajonist!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3693720/d45487c3364a3e4af61d1f1e2da33f225d860c79.jpg"},{"name":"Cajon Club member, Get Da\u2606Ze!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3693720/fc62ff10dab5b5b55bbc7c538239b16aebe236d7.jpg"},{"name":"Vending Machine Mastery Level 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3693720/170e9415022e534d673b801ed43efb0586fb9de5.jpg"},{"name":"Hi Score Cajonist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3693720/da442dab9d63d246464f1aef4ff63d9207d6b86d.jpg"},{"name":"My turn!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic